 "punch": "SORROW",
 "sentences": [
  {
   "slot": "E1",
   "text": "There's something wrong about the way these eyes stare at you, and it isn't evil.",
   "kind": "HOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "eyes",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E2",
   "text": "This is Lucifer, painted by Franz Stuck in 1890.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 1
  },
  {
   "slot": "E3",
   "text": "And this isn't a devil with horns.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "devil",
     "to": "man"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E3",
   "text": "It's a fallen star, sitting in the dark.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "dark",
     "to": "main_action"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E4",
   "text": "Naked, silent, almost human.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E5",
   "text": "But look at his eyes.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E6",
   "text": "He's watching you.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "watching",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E6",
   "text": "There's a pale light burning in both eyes.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E7",
   "text": "Yet it doesn't feel like hatred.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "hatred",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E8",
   "text": "Look into his eyes.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E8",
   "text": "There's grief there.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "grief",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E9",
   "text": "A cold, sleepless, endless sorrow.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E10",
   "text": "As if he still remembers the sky he lost.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "sky",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E11",
   "text": "According to the traditional story of Lucifer, the morning star was banished to Earth for his pride.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 12,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "star",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E11",
   "text": "A century later, Paris and Berlin showed him in an exhibition about melancholy.",
   "kind": "FACT",
   "source": 8,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "melancholy",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E12",
   "text": "And Stuck seems to capture something few painters dared.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "Stuck",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E12",
   "text": "Not the fall everyone paints, but the long night after.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "night",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E12",
   "text": "The moment when he understands the light is never coming back.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "light",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E13",
   "text": "Imagine you were once the brightest star in the sky.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "star",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E13",
   "text": "Would you beg to be forgiven?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E13",
   "text": "Would you try to climb back?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E13",
   "text": "Or would you sit in the dark and stare?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "stare",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E14",
   "text": "That's what makes this painting so hard to look at.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E15",
   "text": "Lucifer is still beautiful, but his eyes no longer seem alive.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "beautiful",
     "to": "face"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E15",
   "text": "His face says one thing, his eyes say another.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "face",
     "to": "face"
    },
    {
     "on": "another",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "slot": "E16",
   "text": "And maybe that is the worst of it.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E17",
   "text": "Maybe darkness doesn't begin with hatred.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E17",
   "text": "Maybe it begins with pride, then becomes loneliness, and eventually turns into sorrow.",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E18",
   "text": "So look at him one more time.",
   "kind": "LOOK",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E19",
   "text": "Do you see the Devil, waiting for his revenge?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null
  },
  {
   "slot": "E19",
   "text": "Or a star that never stopped falling?",
   "kind": "READING",
   "source": null,
   "show": [
    {
     "on": "falling",
     "to": "eyes"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
